From 467ad5b6cc104bbd993a8ad220bbe585a66637be Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: HempFiend <17104973+jaidenscool1@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 14:42:31 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] PROBE: EDEN_NX2_PT_CAPTURE, record one frame of guest GPU
 work for the passthrough replay

Command list entries in execution order, each channel's engine state (3D registers, native compute
registers, MME code/start addresses/data RAM, 3D constant buffer bindings), the GPU VA map, device
memory at the start (after flushing GPU-dirty mappings) and at the end, and the inline QMDs the compute
engine writes. Touch <dir>/capture.now in game: records from the next present for two presents.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
